sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Security Officer / SOC
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant Controller as AttackSurfaceScopeController
    participant Job as EnrichDiscoveredHost Job
    participant Enrichment as DiscoveredHostEnrichmentService
    participant Integration as Shodan / Generic IP Integration
    participant Nmap as NmapScannerService
    participant Nuclei as NucleiScannerService
    participant Sync as Finding / Threat Sync Services
    participant Vuln as VulnerabilityIntelligenceService
    participant DB as MariaDB

    Analyst->>UI: Trigger enrichment for one or more hosts
    UI->>Controller: POST enrichment action
    Controller->>Job: dispatch host enrichment job(s)
    Controller-->>UI: acknowledge queued enrichment

    Job->>Enrichment: enrich(host)
    Enrichment->>DB: Create enrichment run (running)

    opt External integration configured
        Enrichment->>Integration: Fetch passive host intelligence
        Integration-->>Enrichment: Raw payload
        Enrichment->>Vuln: Enrich CVEs with NVD intelligence
        Vuln-->>Enrichment: Normalized vulnerabilities
        Enrichment->>DB: Persist normalized integration run
    end

    opt Nmap enabled
        Enrichment->>Nmap: scan(host)
        Nmap->>Vuln: Enrich detected CVEs
        Vuln-->>Nmap: Normalized vulnerability details
        Nmap-->>Enrichment: Nmap normalized payload
    end

    opt Nuclei enabled
        Enrichment->>Nuclei: scan(host)
        Nuclei->>Vuln: Enrich detected CVEs
        Vuln-->>Nuclei: Normalized vulnerability details
        Nuclei-->>Enrichment: Nuclei normalized payload
    end

    Enrichment->>Sync: Sync findings, threats and asset exposure
    Sync->>DB: Update discovered host findings
    Sync->>DB: Update related asset and external exposure
    Enrichment->>DB: Finalize enrichment run
    Job-->>UI: Enriched host details available
